Package: hospitraceR
Title: Detecting and analyzing nosocomial transmission clusters using genomic epidemiology
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-06-21
Authors@R:
    c(
        person(
            "Abhirath", "Anand",
            email = "abhirath@umich.edu",
            role = c("aut", "cre"),
            comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0008-6985-9266")
        )
    )
Description: Detects transmission clusters of healthcare-associated pathogens by
    combining whole-genome single-nucleotide-variant data with patient location
    traces, surveillance cultures and admission status. Also provides tools to compare
    cluster assignments, to test spatial and temporal patient overlap within clusters by
    permutation, and to categorize the inferred transmission role of each patient.
URL: https://theabhirath.github.io/hospitraceR, https://github.com/theabhirath/hospitraceR
